  "comment": "Published npm packages that ship their TypeScript sources. Every tool bundles the same entries with the same generated tsconfig.bench.json; `entries` maps an output declaration name to a path inside the package. Inputs must check cleanly under the typescript7 version in package.json (the version tsrs ports); docs/DTS.md#benchmark lists the packages and entries left out.",
